[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3722613726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3722613726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3722613726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d4pPe","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T08:03:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T10:03:45Z","body":"Why would anyone want to change this? 🤔 (the margin) This seems to be an unnecessary option","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3722613726/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723048670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3723048670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3723048670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d6Tbe","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T09:44:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T09:46:49Z","body":"According to @caphindsight 's opinion in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114674, he feels it apparently an eyesore.\r\n\r\nAt the very least, I agree that darkening the default and implementing highlights on mouse hovered would be consistent with other rotation gizmo.\r\n\r\nHowever, regarding margins, I believe it should be there as the default because there's a functional issue that causes points to become ungrabbable as I mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114674#issuecomment-3721449084. I'm not sure if making margins an adjustable option is worth it, but it possibly be worth it for users who absolutely require consistency with old layouts.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723048670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723068606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3723068606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3723068606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d6YS-","user":{"login":"caphindsight","id":10833413,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODMzNDEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10833413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight","html_url":"https://github.com/caphindsight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T09:49:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T09:50:21Z","body":"This gizmo is such a core part of Godot. You basically see it everywhere all the time if you work with 3d. It makes sense to make it at the very least configurable.\r\n\r\n@rptfrg I can almost guarantee that you will receive similar feedback from other users who haven't caught up to these changes yet, if this goes to release. It wouldn't be the case for a more obscure feature, this gizmo is just that ubiquitous","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723068606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723228000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3723228000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3723228000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d6_Ng","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T10:31:11Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T08:25:13Z","body":"Only my personal opinion of course, but I'm just not seeing the point of adding this option.\r\n\r\n1) Making it smaller impairs it's function by making it more difficult to click, (as TokageItLab mentioned) you will have to hunt for pixels. If you're using it a lot, you wouldn't want to do that. If you're not using it much and finding it to be an eyesore, it would make more sense to just add a flag that disables it completely.\r\n2) There is no point of making it bigger either.\r\n\r\nIt's been this way in Blender for years without people complaining, so I'm not sure people will find it too surprising / annoying (I haven't even noticed the change, until randomly opening this pull request 😀)\r\n\r\n|Blender 2.79|Blender 5.0|\r\n-|-|\r\n|<img width=\"340\" height=\"308\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53beef4d-8885-466d-98fd-14cfcc1d3136\" />|<img width=\"340\" height=\"324\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/840e11ac-f779-4bca-a494-286271bf1838\" />|\r\n\r\nTo reiterate, this option allows you to either:\r\n1) \"Break\" the proper functionality of the gizmo, making it less functional.\r\n2) Or to do something useless (?) with it.\r\n\r\nWhat's the use-case of increasing this margin, who may ever need to do that for any reason? Unless I'm missing something, I think increasing it has no utility? I think customization options should have at least some utility!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723228000/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723449387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3723449387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3723449387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d71Qr","user":{"login":"caphindsight","id":10833413,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODMzNDEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10833413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight","html_url":"https://github.com/caphindsight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T11:29:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T11:29:20Z","body":"@rptfrg I take your point about Blender. I'm a long time Blender user, yet I didn't know this, due to never using their rotation gizmo in practice - I do everything with hotkeys.\r\n\r\nIn Godot, the Blender's `g/r/s -> x/y/z -> ...` shortcut scheme isn't supported (potentially a future improvement?), so I have always used the gizmos.\r\n\r\nBut even if the new style of the gizmo is considered better by the majority of users, wouldn't it still make sense to make these things configurable to satisfy everybody? I'm surprised at why you're objecting to a PR that adds configuration options. Worst thing that can happen is not many people will set this option, that's probably true for many other configuration options already.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723449387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3743524009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3743524009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3743524009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fIaSp","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T10:24:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T10:24:29Z","body":"CC @ryevdokimov @Calinou ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3743524009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3744526473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3744526473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3744526473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fMPCJ","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T14:06:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T14:06:26Z","body":"If we do add this as an editor setting, it should made so the editor doesn't need to be restarted like other transform gizmo related settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3744526473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3746258054","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3746258054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3746258054,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fS1yG","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T19:52:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T19:54:08Z","body":"@ryevdokimov The issue is that the radius value is used across several classes, and values like this that are frequently accessed should be cached whenever possible. This is because the process of loading editor settings is considered to have some costs.\r\n\r\nIdeally, we'd cache it within NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED at the lowest possible level. However, since the redrawing process after recaching isn't properly implemented in Gizmo yet, I assume this way is fine for now. If you wish to improve it, you can follow up with a PR later. In any case, the radius shouldn't a parameter that's set frequently except the first time.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3746258054/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3751576284","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114717#issuecomment-3751576284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114717","id":3751576284,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fnILc","user":{"login":"yusuf-123-3","id":112316148,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrHO9A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112316148?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusuf-123-3","html_url":"https://github.com/yusuf-123-3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusuf-123-3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusuf-123-3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusuf-123-3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusuf-123-3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusuf-123-3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.